            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La tabella <code>users</code> necessita di una nuova colonna <code>age</code>. Quale clausola va inserita dopo <code>ALTER TABLE users</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ADD age</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP COLUMN age</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>RENAME age TO users</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>ADD age</code>.</p></body></html>"
